WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.785
Consistency, not sameness.

00:00:02.835 --> 00:00:05.875
Keep the core idea, voice and assets.

00:00:05.925 --> 00:00:08.021
Update the executions, tension and channels.

00:00:08.071 --> 00:00:12.394
And never let a bored brand manager change everything.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.055
KitKat still says have a break.

00:00:15.105 --> 00:00:16.859
But Gen Z can't switch off,

00:00:16.909 --> 00:00:18.486
so the break is now for the mind,

00:00:18.536 --> 00:00:20.170
not just the body.

00:00:20.867 --> 00:00:22.338
Meanwhile a new manager,

00:00:22.388 --> 00:00:23.576
bored of the old ads,

00:00:23.626 --> 00:00:24.956
wants to scrap it all.

00:00:25.006 --> 00:00:27.769
That throws away years of built memory.

00:00:28.467 --> 00:00:29.667
Use it like this:

00:00:29.717 --> 00:00:31.283
turn up differently each time,

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:32.332
but keep the idea,

00:00:32.382 --> 00:00:35.097
voice and craft the same.
